<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6774674942"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:19.244"><div begin="21.074" end="37.357" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="21.074" end="24.897" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.074" end="22.458">经济高速发展</span> <span begin="22.458" end="23.250">我的薪水</span><span begin="23.250" end="24.205">还是一千</span><span begin="24.205" end="24.897">五</span></p><p begin="25.239" end="29.070" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.239" end="26.159">一天到晚</span><span begin="26.159" end="26.877">拼了命</span> <span begin="26.877" end="27.867">上司还嫌</span><span begin="27.867" end="28.483">不够辛</span><span begin="28.483" end="29.070">苦</span></p><p begin="29.375" end="33.195" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.375" end="30.282">也没关系</span> <span begin="30.282" end="31.453">反正我一日三餐</span><span begin="31.453" end="32.229">都习惯</span><span begin="32.229" end="32.522">吃</span><span begin="32.522" end="33.195">土</span></p><p begin="33.467" end="37.357" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.467" end="34.464">昨天晚餐</span><span begin="34.464" end="34.838">还有</span><span begin="34.838" end="35.250">剩</span> <span begin="35.250" end="36.163">要不要给你</span><span begin="36.163" end="36.691">补一</span><span begin="36.691" end="37.357">补</span></p></div><div begin="36.788" end="53.406" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="36.788" end="40.853" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.788" end="37.325">吃点</span><span begin="37.325" end="37.741">土</span><span begin="37.741" end="38.313">不算</span><span begin="38.313" end="38.789">苦</span> <span begin="38.879" end="39.773">等我薪水</span><span begin="39.773" end="40.240">两千</span><span begin="40.240" end="40.853">五</span></p><p begin="40.978" end="44.949" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.978" end="41.393">找师</span><span begin="41.393" end="41.898">傅</span><span begin="41.898" end="42.396">纹老</span><span begin="42.396" end="42.910">虎</span> <span begin="43.022" end="43.863">图案找错</sp